WEBVTT

00:19.640 --> 00:23.370
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:23.640 --> 00:28.870
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:29.040 --> 00:34.570
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:34.750 --> 00:39.920
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:40.090 --> 00:45.360
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:45.660 --> 00:51.070
<i>Will you ever know how I feel? Will you</i>
<i>ever know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:51.300 --> 00:56.740
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.910 --> 01:02.170
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:02.380 --> 01:10.080
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:23.400 --> 01:24.870
ACHOO!

01:27.000 --> 01:28.530
Uh-oh, is that a cold?

01:28.640 --> 01:31.400
Nah, someone's probably
badmouthing me right now.

01:31.510 --> 01:35.270
Maybe you got a little carried
away at boxing practice?

01:35.380 --> 01:38.040
Oh, that? I didn't do anything, really!

01:38.150 --> 01:41.280
But to think that those boys actually
beat the No. 1 boxing team in Japan!

01:41.380 --> 01:43.550
That's a hell of a group, Class 2-4!

01:43.750 --> 01:45.190
They're really something.

01:45.290 --> 01:47.190
I agree, they sure are!

01:47.290 --> 01:51.750
Well, you know, those kids of mine
are a lot gutsier than they look...

01:51.860 --> 01:54.490
Granted, their grades are lamentable,
but...

01:54.600 --> 01:57.260
...you could be right
about them being gutsy.

01:57.400 --> 01:58.460
I agree!

01:58.570 --> 01:59.830
Now, now!

02:01.270 --> 02:04.240
<i>YANKUMI'S FINAL ACT OF HONOR!</i>

02:04.670 --> 02:09.810
Hearing all that praise for my
students really makes me happy!

02:11.650 --> 02:15.080
Is this motherly pride, no,
teacherly pride?

02:15.180 --> 02:16.450
Hey! Yankumi!

02:16.550 --> 02:17.080
Huh?

02:17.220 --> 02:20.550
What are you smirking about,
for chrissake? It's really creepy!

02:20.660 --> 02:23.630
Well, since we did get
to be No. 1 in Japan...

02:23.760 --> 02:25.730
I was thinking we should do something...

02:25.830 --> 02:26.760
Good idea!

02:26.860 --> 02:28.420
Prize money, prize money!

02:28.530 --> 02:29.360
Moron!

02:29.700 --> 02:33.660
I'll see to it that it's a
once-in-a-lifetime experience for you guys!

02:34.100 --> 02:35.330
What's up with that?

02:35.440 --> 02:37.170
That's nothing to look forward to!

02:37.270 --> 02:38.570
That doesn't tell us anything!

02:38.670 --> 02:39.800
What is it you're gonna do for us?

02:40.040 --> 02:42.010
I'm still in the planning stages, see.

02:42.110 --> 02:43.840
Just give me some time, OK?

02:46.680 --> 02:48.150
My head feels heavy...

02:48.320 --> 02:49.810
Maybe I do have a cold.

02:52.150 --> 02:54.520
Is she under the weather?

02:54.620 --> 02:56.960
Nah, probably not.

03:01.200 --> 03:05.330
Ms. Yamaguchi, don't think
you're going to get away with this.

03:07.470 --> 03:10.230
Hey! Put some spirit into
your cleaning, willya?

03:10.340 --> 03:11.200
Right!

03:12.070 --> 03:13.570
I'm back!

03:13.840 --> 03:15.970
Ojou! Welcome home.

03:16.080 --> 03:17.880
Welcome home, Ojou.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.950
Hope you had a good day at work.

03:20.020 --> 03:20.640
Yeah...

03:23.220 --> 03:24.880
Ojou, did you catch a cold?

03:24.990 --> 03:25.850
Mmm...

03:26.460 --> 03:27.920
Now that's not good.

03:28.020 --> 03:29.010
What's that?

03:29.160 --> 03:31.130
Ojou! Are you all right?

03:31.230 --> 03:34.030
I'm going to go make you
some chicken soup right away...

03:34.130 --> 03:35.890
Tetsu, Minoru! Send for the doctor!

03:36.030 --> 03:36.590
Right!

03:36.730 --> 03:38.460
Wakamatsu! Turn down her bed!

03:38.530 --> 03:39.560
I'm on it!

03:39.700 --> 03:42.970
Hold on, Kyo!
It's really not a big deal...

03:43.070 --> 03:46.870
Oh no! Ojou, you are the
Ooedo Clan's precious heir.

03:47.040 --> 03:49.770
We can't risk anything happening to you!

03:49.880 --> 03:51.780
But this is overkill, Kyo.

03:53.580 --> 03:55.140
Oh! Consigliere!

03:55.250 --> 03:55.880
Huh?

03:56.320 --> 03:58.120
Kumiko, are you all right?

03:58.220 --> 03:59.690
Oh, I've got a cold...

04:01.520 --> 04:04.430
What? Then you shouldn't be
standing around outside.

04:04.530 --> 04:06.320
Come on, let's get you inside now.

04:06.430 --> 04:07.090
All right.

04:08.500 --> 04:09.060
Huh?

04:16.210 --> 04:18.800
Hey, dirtbag!
What are you taking pictures of?

04:18.910 --> 04:20.240
What the hell ya think you're doing?

04:20.340 --> 04:21.440
Who the hell are you?

04:21.540 --> 04:22.270
Hold it.

04:23.210 --> 04:24.180
Ojou!

04:27.550 --> 04:30.450
Is this a home visit, Vice Principal?

04:31.650 --> 04:33.020
Ms. Yamaguchi...

04:33.190 --> 04:36.820
I am certainly taken back to find that
you live in such a grand residence.

04:37.030 --> 04:40.000
I must report this to
the Chairman immediately.

04:40.860 --> 04:43.330
Of course, it is logical to assume...

04:43.430 --> 04:46.930
...that the Board of Directors will
have no choice but to close down...

04:47.070 --> 04:49.800
...a school that employs
a yakuza heiress!

04:49.910 --> 04:50.800
But that's...

04:51.410 --> 04:53.970
Please excuse me, Ms. Yamaguchi.

04:54.780 --> 04:55.770
Oh, crap!

04:55.880 --> 05:00.010
Ojou, if you like I'll go after him
and toss him into the harbor.

05:00.220 --> 05:01.710
Don't do that, Kyo.

05:01.850 --> 05:04.320
This is something I'll have
to deal with in a katagi way.

05:04.420 --> 05:05.180
Right.

05:05.720 --> 05:07.310
Kumiko...

05:08.560 --> 05:10.190
It just might be...

05:15.300 --> 05:17.130
...time to end it.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.530
Ojou...

05:21.700 --> 05:25.610
That teacher-bitch! She screwed me
over enough, but now...

05:26.510 --> 05:28.910
...I'm going to use her to my advantage.

05:29.010 --> 05:32.040
To help me get to the
top of the Nekomata Group!

05:35.850 --> 05:38.380
Vice Principal, good job
ferreting out her secret.

05:38.490 --> 05:41.290
This new information will go a long way
towards convincing the board...

05:41.390 --> 05:42.980
...once more to close down this school.

05:43.090 --> 05:43.960
Yes, sir!

05:44.090 --> 05:46.060
<i>LETTER OF RESIGNATION</i>

05:46.160 --> 05:47.750
Huh?

05:49.260 --> 05:52.100
This is from Kumiko Yamaguchi?

05:52.170 --> 05:54.530
That is correct.
Just now, out of the blue...

05:54.640 --> 05:57.630
But why didn't you stop her?
She has to be holding down her job or...

05:57.710 --> 05:59.230
...the impact will be...

05:58.740 --> 05:59.230
What?

05:59.480 --> 06:00.840
Never mind!

06:00.940 --> 06:02.540
Oh! Chairman!

06:05.580 --> 06:07.050
Ms. Yamaguchi...

06:07.550 --> 06:10.250
Vice Principal! How could you
let her outmaneuver us?

06:10.320 --> 06:12.020
Please forgive me, sir!

06:12.120 --> 06:14.780
But I had no idea that
Kumiko Yamaguchi would...

06:14.890 --> 06:16.950
...make up her mind
to resign so quickly.

06:17.530 --> 06:18.260
Huh?

06:20.130 --> 06:23.070
Uchi, where the heck is Shin today?

06:23.200 --> 06:26.640
Well, first period's gym.
No way is he showing up.

06:26.770 --> 06:28.760
Kuma's coming in late, too. Huh?

06:29.370 --> 06:30.930
Hey, have you guys heard?

06:31.040 --> 06:31.560
Huh?

06:50.090 --> 06:51.460
Hey! Hold up!

06:51.560 --> 06:54.660
Yankumi! Is it true that
you're quitting school?

06:54.930 --> 06:56.400
It's just a joke, right?

06:56.730 --> 06:57.630
It's true.

06:58.070 --> 07:00.700
But why? Did you screw up, or something?

07:01.140 --> 07:01.730
Nope.

07:02.170 --> 07:04.300
Was that douchebag
Vice Principal bullying you?

07:04.410 --> 07:05.070
Nope.

07:05.340 --> 07:06.830
Then what's up?

07:07.840 --> 07:09.330
Damn! Don't tell me...

07:09.440 --> 07:11.780
You kicked the crap out
of the Vice Principal!

07:11.880 --> 07:14.540
Don't tell me, you were caught
chiseling the school?

07:14.650 --> 07:15.880
Or is it a guy?

07:16.220 --> 07:17.520
You get knocked up?

07:17.750 --> 07:21.120
I just got sick of
babysitting scum like you.

07:21.790 --> 07:23.050
What did you just say?

07:23.360 --> 07:25.790
You're a bunch of lamebrains,
and you're butt-ugly.

07:25.890 --> 07:28.130
Not only that, but you have no balls.

07:28.460 --> 07:33.130
It finally hit me that I was just wasting
my time, trying to teach your sorry asses.

07:33.270 --> 07:34.630
Do you really mean it?

07:34.770 --> 07:36.830
You've never talked
to us like this before...

07:36.940 --> 07:41.640
Oh, till now I was holding it back,
just for my paycheck...see?

07:42.910 --> 07:44.780
But enough is enough.

07:44.880 --> 07:48.910
If I hang around you guys, I'm
gonna start smelling like scum too.

07:49.250 --> 07:50.620
You bitch!

07:50.850 --> 07:52.620
What? You wanna fight?

07:53.720 --> 07:55.850
What good would it do to hit you?

07:56.060 --> 08:00.020
So you don't hit girls.
Is that you trying to be cool?

08:00.130 --> 08:01.720
Doesn't become you!

08:01.860 --> 08:03.630
Bitch, I'm really gonna hit you!

08:03.770 --> 08:04.930
Let's see you do it.

08:05.030 --> 08:07.900
Scum like you can grandstand all day,
but it doesn't mean shit.

08:08.040 --> 08:11.130
You don't even have the balls to hit me.
Scum like you are all bark and no bite!

08:11.240 --> 08:12.230
Shut up!

08:12.410 --> 08:13.740
Goddamn you!

08:16.580 --> 08:20.670
Huh! You can't even hit a girl.
What a loser!

08:21.150 --> 08:23.780
You guys are all
worthless sons of bitches!

08:23.920 --> 08:24.890
You bitch!

08:25.120 --> 08:26.380
Don't screw with us!

08:26.590 --> 08:27.950
Let's get her!

08:40.970 --> 08:42.030
Crap!

08:44.170 --> 08:46.730
I'm glad that I got to be your teacher...

08:47.040 --> 08:48.530
Goddamn you...

08:56.790 --> 09:00.550
Now that I've put an end to it,
I won't have any regrets.

09:02.190 --> 09:03.490
Take care, now!

09:05.860 --> 09:08.300
That bitch, how come she's so strong?

09:08.400 --> 09:09.190
Crap!

09:09.330 --> 09:12.770
Yankumi was the only one,
not like the other teachers...

09:13.940 --> 09:15.430
She's just like the rest...

09:15.570 --> 09:18.440
...that stinking moron teacher!

09:19.310 --> 09:23.270
I think my temperature went up
after all that brawling.

09:23.380 --> 09:25.750
My legs are so shaky...

09:28.280 --> 09:31.310
Hey! Long time no see, Teacher-bitch!

09:31.490 --> 09:32.280
Huh?

09:32.590 --> 09:35.420
Don't tell me you're
still skulking around here!

09:35.520 --> 09:37.290
Huh! Shut up!

09:37.660 --> 09:40.290
I just want you to come with us, okay?

09:40.600 --> 09:41.590
Take a hike.

09:41.730 --> 09:43.860
I don't feel like
fooling around with you...

09:45.400 --> 09:48.270
You better just come with us,
if you wanna be safe.

09:48.800 --> 09:52.570
We'll treat you nice and gentle,
so come on...

09:55.440 --> 09:58.900
I told you, I don't feel like fooling
around with you jokers right now!

09:59.080 --> 09:59.710
Huh?

10:08.620 --> 10:09.610
What the hell?

10:16.830 --> 10:17.360
Huh?

10:23.310 --> 10:24.240
What?

10:28.980 --> 10:30.950
That you, Kuma? What's up?

10:31.050 --> 10:32.670
Shin! It's Yankumi...

10:45.890 --> 10:46.760
Shin...

10:46.860 --> 10:48.160
Where's Yamaguchi?

10:48.900 --> 10:49.830
In there?

10:50.000 --> 10:50.660
Right.

10:50.870 --> 10:52.460
They just carried her in.

10:52.670 --> 10:54.260
How many on their side?

10:54.370 --> 10:55.770
I think there's 3...

10:56.070 --> 10:56.770
Huh!

10:57.810 --> 10:59.400
Shin! You can't!

10:59.510 --> 11:00.910
Kuma! Let me go!

11:01.040 --> 11:03.530
Those guys are freakin' gangsters!
You'll get yourself killed!

11:03.650 --> 11:05.440
But what about Yamaguchi?

11:05.610 --> 11:08.580
If you just barge in there,
it'll be bad for Yankumi too, see?

11:09.790 --> 11:10.620
Crap!

11:13.190 --> 11:14.420
Shin.

11:14.960 --> 11:17.260
We're in way over our heads this time.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.660
We should go to the police.

11:18.760 --> 11:19.390
No good.

11:19.730 --> 11:21.360
That would really screw her over.

11:21.460 --> 11:22.950
Huh? But why?

11:23.200 --> 11:23.860
Kuma...

11:24.500 --> 11:26.470
Do you remember the Ooedo Clan?

11:26.600 --> 11:27.160
Huh?

11:27.700 --> 11:28.670
Yeah.

11:29.140 --> 11:31.660
Go over there now and
tell them what's going on.

11:31.770 --> 11:34.070
Why? They scare the hell outta me...

11:34.180 --> 11:36.240
You'll be all right. I swear!

11:36.340 --> 11:38.140
No way! They'll kill me...

11:38.380 --> 11:40.140
Kuma! You've got to!

11:41.120 --> 11:42.480
Shin.

11:45.590 --> 11:47.920
Why do I have to go to the Ooedo Clan?

11:50.060 --> 11:53.150
No, I can't do it. I'm gonna go
get the guys instead...

11:58.570 --> 12:00.470
Kuma, hurry up!

12:01.170 --> 12:03.660
Nakanishi! Stand guard over her.

12:04.270 --> 12:06.830
We're off to see the Nekomata Boss.

12:06.940 --> 12:07.970
Right!

12:15.620 --> 12:17.680
So there's only one lookout now, huh?

12:32.200 --> 12:33.290
My bad!

12:36.340 --> 12:38.470
Yamaguchi, are you all right?

12:38.540 --> 12:40.480
She's really burning up.

12:46.210 --> 12:47.480
Ow...

12:51.050 --> 12:52.880
Huh? What did you say?

12:53.020 --> 12:57.190
I said Yankumi's being held captive
in the Kamiyama-Cho warehouse!

12:57.360 --> 12:59.330
Kudoh and some yakuzas
are mixed up in this...

12:59.390 --> 13:00.620
Yeah, so what?

13:00.800 --> 13:02.560
It's got nothing to do with us!

13:02.700 --> 13:03.320
Huh?

13:03.500 --> 13:05.470
Just leave it alone, will you?

13:05.870 --> 13:07.030
That's right!

13:07.270 --> 13:10.000
Who cares about someone who quit?

13:10.170 --> 13:13.160
Huh? She quit? You mean Yankumi?

13:13.280 --> 13:13.940
Right.

13:14.040 --> 13:16.910
As far as we're concerned,
she doesn't mean shit to us!

13:17.010 --> 13:18.310
But Shin is...

13:18.450 --> 13:22.280
Just forget about Yankumi,
and tell Shin to come back.

13:22.850 --> 13:25.550
What's wrong with you guys?

13:35.000 --> 13:36.760
You're still getting up?

13:37.330 --> 13:39.770
If Kudoh and the others come back now...

13:43.440 --> 13:45.410
Dammit, go down already!

13:52.950 --> 13:54.640
Come on, let's go!

13:54.750 --> 13:57.120
I mean, Shin might
have already busted in...

13:57.290 --> 13:59.750
Like Shin would do
something stupid like that.

13:59.850 --> 14:01.050
Hey, Minami!

14:01.160 --> 14:02.490
Back off, man!

14:03.690 --> 14:05.660
You guys are cool with this?

14:05.760 --> 14:07.730
How can you abandon Yankumi?

14:07.860 --> 14:11.060
Has she ever abandoned us till now?

14:11.700 --> 14:13.260
So what if she did quit school!

14:13.400 --> 14:17.130
But is that any reason to just
forget how much we owe Yankumi?

14:17.940 --> 14:20.570
Crap! Okay, fine!
I don't need your help!

14:24.010 --> 14:24.670
Hey.

14:24.950 --> 14:27.180
Maybe we should at least
go to the police.

14:27.320 --> 14:28.940
What's that?
<i>NEKOMATA GROUP</i>

14:29.080 --> 14:32.280
You kidnapped the granddaughter
of the Ooedo Kumicho?

14:32.390 --> 14:35.020
The Nekomata Group can't expand with...

14:35.120 --> 14:37.120
...the Ooedo Clan in our way, can it?

14:37.260 --> 14:40.560
If we take their granddaughter hostage,
we can have our way with...

14:40.660 --> 14:41.990
...Ryuichi Kuroda!

14:42.060 --> 14:43.790
You little retard!

14:43.970 --> 14:44.590
Huh?

14:45.630 --> 14:48.190
You don't know jack, you piss-ant!

14:48.340 --> 14:50.170
You're living in a dream world
if you think...

14:50.240 --> 14:52.140
...it's that easy to
take on the Ooedo Clan!

14:52.240 --> 14:54.270
Are you trying to destroy my Group?

14:54.380 --> 14:58.510
But there's nothing to worry about.
It's just a piss-ant clan!

14:58.650 --> 14:59.770
You little dumbass!

15:00.020 --> 15:02.850
Just one word from
that Ryuichiro Kuroda...

15:02.980 --> 15:06.080
...and a whole buttload of gangsters
will be after our asses!

15:06.190 --> 15:07.950
All you have to do is really piss...

15:08.060 --> 15:10.650
...that guy off and there'll be
nowhere in Japan for you to hide!

15:10.760 --> 15:11.490
Yeah, but...

15:11.560 --> 15:12.580
Shut the hell up!

15:12.690 --> 15:15.760
Goddammit. There's no way out
of this unless we manage to...

15:15.860 --> 15:19.160
...get rid of that granddaughter
without leaving a fricking trace!

15:19.270 --> 15:20.860
I want everyone here!

15:21.000 --> 15:23.670
There's no telling when the
Ooedo Clan will make a move!

15:23.770 --> 15:26.800
There's not a moment to lose
if you wanna stay alive!

15:37.290 --> 15:38.310
I'm done.

15:38.520 --> 15:40.110
I've got nothing left...

15:42.090 --> 15:44.250
Hey, what's so funny?

15:44.690 --> 15:46.030
Consigliere?

15:46.130 --> 15:46.790
Huh?

15:47.030 --> 15:49.190
Mr. Shinohara?

15:55.540 --> 15:57.440
I don't need that crap.

15:57.910 --> 15:58.870
That...

15:59.610 --> 16:01.940
...that really pisses me off, you know!

16:04.380 --> 16:06.910
What do you think you're doing, Sawada?

16:07.020 --> 16:09.450
You've got a lot of
balls to mess with us.

16:10.390 --> 16:15.450
I do feel bad for you, but I can't let
either of you leave this place alive.

16:20.660 --> 16:23.460
You're history, Sawada.

16:30.410 --> 16:30.930
Huh?

16:34.780 --> 16:36.110
<i>Congratulations! You're No. 1 in Japan!</i>

16:35.610 --> 16:36.810
What the hell is this?

16:36.240 --> 16:37.740
<i>Now you, too can be sure to score 100!</i>

16:37.910 --> 16:40.970
Well, since we did get
to be No. 1 in Japan...

16:41.150 --> 16:43.480
I was thinking maybe
we should do something...

16:44.520 --> 16:47.680
I'll see to it that it's a
once-in-a-lifetime experience for you guys!

16:48.660 --> 16:51.060
Damn her! Making fun of us like that!

16:51.160 --> 16:54.530
This crap would only make
kindergarten babies happy.

16:54.900 --> 16:57.700
But do you think after doing something
retarded like this, she'd leave...

16:57.770 --> 16:59.290
...school the way she did?

16:59.430 --> 17:02.600
Has she ever abandoned us until now?

17:08.980 --> 17:10.470
That's right, boys.

17:10.580 --> 17:14.980
Ms. Yamaguchi would never give up
her job as your teacher so easily.

17:17.690 --> 17:21.020
Hey, sorry to rain on
your parade, Sawada!

17:21.120 --> 17:24.120
I'll bury you two together,
real cozy, so cheer up!

17:24.230 --> 17:25.690
Die, bastard!

17:30.000 --> 17:31.130
Yamaguchi...

17:33.470 --> 17:35.300
Mess with my students...

17:36.400 --> 17:37.500
Bitch...

17:38.140 --> 17:39.630
...and I'll have your...

17:39.840 --> 17:40.670
...ASS!

17:47.820 --> 17:49.380
Shin, you all right?

17:51.190 --> 17:52.620
Yankumi!

17:53.290 --> 17:54.380
You guys...

17:54.620 --> 17:55.610
...but why?

17:55.790 --> 17:57.550
You dumbasses! Get outa here!

17:57.660 --> 17:59.060
Shut up!

18:01.060 --> 18:05.020
"No. 1 in Japan" test! Don't think you
can con us with bullshit like that!

18:05.130 --> 18:08.630
The principal says he's not
accepting your resignation, moron!

18:08.770 --> 18:09.860
Goddamn you!

18:10.140 --> 18:11.470
You guys...

18:11.740 --> 18:12.800
Morons!

18:12.910 --> 18:16.780
If I didn't make it that easy,
you'd never get a perfect score!

18:19.050 --> 18:22.310
What a mess, there's no way
I can take care of...

18:24.590 --> 18:27.150
Little Mr. Nekomata...

18:27.490 --> 18:29.890
...looks like you've been doing
too much playing around...

18:29.990 --> 18:31.080
Mr. Kuroda!

18:31.190 --> 18:33.490
Believe me, I can explain everything!

18:33.600 --> 18:35.060
You're a disgrace.

18:35.360 --> 18:38.630
Gangsters don't make
excuses for their actions.

18:38.770 --> 18:41.030
Wakamatsu, teach him a lesson!

18:41.170 --> 18:42.100
Yes, sir.

18:47.140 --> 18:50.240
This time, it's a surefire scandal!

18:51.810 --> 18:54.780
Over my dead body, asshole!

18:55.880 --> 18:56.940
Hey!

18:57.690 --> 18:59.210
Vice Principal!

18:59.820 --> 19:04.160
Don't you forget that Ojou and
that school have the Ooedo Clan...

19:04.260 --> 19:06.320
...watching their backs.

19:07.800 --> 19:11.600
I bet the water in Tokyo Bay's
really, really cold...

19:11.730 --> 19:15.070
I haven't done anything!

19:19.410 --> 19:22.000
It's been a while since
I've felt this beat.

19:22.110 --> 19:23.010
Ouch...

19:23.180 --> 19:26.240
Those yakuzas,
they really are a badass bunch.

19:26.350 --> 19:28.440
Shin, I was scared shitless!

19:28.550 --> 19:29.780
You did a good job!

19:29.950 --> 19:31.040
Guys...

19:31.190 --> 19:33.310
I appreciate your coming to help me...

19:33.420 --> 19:36.550
...but I want you to stop poking your
noses into dangerous crap like this.

19:36.660 --> 19:37.680
What about you?

19:37.790 --> 19:40.820
Stop getting involved
in crazy crap yourself!

19:40.960 --> 19:43.560
It's not easy having a freaky
homeroom teacher like you.

19:43.700 --> 19:44.560
Damn right!

19:44.700 --> 19:47.640
Thanks to you, we're all
headed for early graves!

19:48.200 --> 19:49.430
Hey, you guys...

19:49.840 --> 19:51.360
...you've got some nerve!

19:52.270 --> 19:52.740
Huh?

19:53.410 --> 19:54.310
Kumiko!

19:54.680 --> 19:56.540
Consigliere!

20:00.250 --> 20:01.410
Are you all right?

20:01.620 --> 20:03.980
They told me over the phone,
I was so worried I drove right over!

20:04.090 --> 20:05.180
Consigliere!

20:12.860 --> 20:15.560
Hey you, you got here too late.

20:15.630 --> 20:16.190
Huh?

20:18.300 --> 20:19.860
Hey, Sawada!

20:20.800 --> 20:23.140
Consigliere, I'll see you later.

20:23.270 --> 20:24.760
Shin, wait up!

20:24.910 --> 20:27.000
Hey, we're coming too!

20:27.110 --> 20:28.770
Yankumi, wait up!

20:32.210 --> 20:33.440
Oshima...

20:34.050 --> 20:38.140
It looks like Kumiko is walking
her chosen path very well.

20:38.250 --> 20:39.020
Yes, sir!

20:39.520 --> 20:42.010
Shin, what are you so pissed about?

20:42.290 --> 20:44.090
I'm not pissed about anything.

20:46.760 --> 20:49.820
Hey, Yankumi. We don't feel
like going back to school.

20:49.960 --> 20:51.360
Why don't we just call it day?

20:51.500 --> 20:52.730
Don't gimme that, moron!

20:52.870 --> 20:54.730
We're going back to school
and you're taking that test!

20:54.870 --> 20:55.460
Huh?

20:55.670 --> 20:57.700
You mean that test for first-graders?

20:57.810 --> 20:59.030
Huh? What's that?

20:59.710 --> 21:01.540
No, I've changed my mind.

21:01.680 --> 21:05.240
Only the guy who reaches the
classroom first can take that test!

21:05.350 --> 21:06.040
Huh?

21:06.210 --> 21:08.710
Any of you starts whining,
I'll flunk you on the spot!

21:08.820 --> 21:10.680
On your mark, get set...

21:10.790 --> 21:11.810
GO!

21:11.950 --> 21:13.920
That's a dirty trick, Yankumi!

21:14.020 --> 21:15.650
I don't believe this crap!

21:18.760 --> 21:21.590
Hey, Shin! Let's see you try
and beat me!

21:24.930 --> 21:27.270
That test belongs to me!

21:27.700 --> 21:28.800
Dammit!

21:29.340 --> 21:31.470
They're all banged up...

21:31.840 --> 21:34.810
I wonder if they got into
another fight somewhere?

21:34.910 --> 21:37.880
Class 2-4 again? They're incorrigible!

21:38.110 --> 21:40.810
Yes, but they do have a lot of energy.

21:41.280 --> 21:43.250
There's nothing like youth!

21:43.350 --> 21:48.310
If only they had better looks, they'd be
ripe for the picking in a couple of years...

21:48.420 --> 21:49.120
Huh?

21:50.430 --> 21:52.330
Ripe for what?

21:53.190 --> 21:55.750
Slowpokes! Come on!
You can do better than that!

22:07.740 --> 22:17.740
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:18.790 --> 22:28.690
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:29.500 --> 22:39.200
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:39.510 --> 22:44.410
<i>On those days when</i>
<i>I am alone and cold...</i>

22:44.650 --> 22:49.550
<i>...I'll light a fire with</i>
<i>my own two hands.</i>

22:49.980 --> 22:54.920
<i>The treacherous mountains</i>
<i>are my chosen path.</i>

22:55.090 --> 23:01.860
<i>I'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>without a backward glance.</i>
